# Raw or third-party research material
# Keep reproducibility scripts and curated Markdown reports in Git. Generated
# measurements remain local because they include raw provider data, machine
# paths, large hash manifests, profiler output, and noisy secret-scan matches.
docs/references/
docs/remediations/
AUDIT_REPORT*.md
experiments/**
!experiments/**/
!experiments/**/*.py
!experiments/**/*.md

# Public documentation keeps curated reports and a small explicit screenshot
# set. Raw command logs, hash inventories, recorded market payloads, proof JSON,
# duplicated source snapshots, and exploratory P5-P7 work remain local.
docs/**/*.txt
docs/**/*.json
docs/**/baseline/
docs/**/*.png
